  "body": "Does ng test --isolate still stall, and does plain Vitest stall with isolate: false?\n\nDoes the browser console or network log show net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED (container start adds network interfaces, and Chromium aborts in-flight requests on network changes), or a 504 \"Outdated Optimize Dep\" response (with DEBUG=vite:*), as in vitest-dev/vitest#11171?",
